### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /v1/orders/{orderId}/sub-orders — Sub-orders of an order
### OrderController.listSubOrders
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@orderBase = {{host}}/v1/orders

###
# @name list-sub-orders-ok
### [1] Happy path
GET {{orderBase}}/{{orderId}}/sub-orders

###
# @name list-sub-orders-not-found
### [2] Order not found (expect 404)
GET {{orderBase}}/{{randomUuid}}/sub-orders
